# Environment
- I am using Windows 11 x64, Powershell for command line.
- I am using Python 3.13 with Poetry for dependency management.
- I am using Pydantic v2.9.0+ with proper type hints.
- I am using MongoDB as the primary database.
- I am using LaTeX for document generation.

This project is a migration from an older project. 
Code is run with poetry run streamlit run main.py command